	<tr><td style="padding: 1px 1px 0 1px;">
		<a name="msg1789"></a>
		<table cellpadding="3" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="100%">
			<tr><td class="windowbg">
				<table width="100%" cellpadding="5" cellspacing="0">
					<tr>
						<td valign="top" width="15%" rowspan="2">
							<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=232" title="View the profile of RNWatcher">RNWatcher</a></b><br />
							<span class="smalltext">
								Orc Pawn<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/star.gif" alt="*" border="0" /><br />
								Posts: 4<br />
								<br />
								<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/YaBBImages/avatars/blank.gif" alt="" border="0" /><br />
								I&#039;m a llama!<br />
								<br />
								
								
								
								<br />
								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?action=profile;u=232"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/icons/profile_sm.gif" alt="View Profile" title="View Profile" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1789#msg1789"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1789#msg1789">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #32 on:</b> September 25, 2003, 12:47:14 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							before we go and throw a reign of storms is so awsome party we need to remeber on thing, &nbsp;they didnt get to the elemental planes with out ascent holding there hands and killing RZTW for them and showing them how to do it. &nbsp;yup they have done alot with less thats a fact. &nbsp;but they dont have there vt keys and lets face it VT gear &gt; ornate gear. &nbsp;anyone how knows anything knows that vt has the best gear in the land proble even better then most elemental stuff, &nbsp;but ya vt is outdated cuse it was 3 exp. ago. &nbsp;and one that thinks vt is a waste of time hasn't been to vt and seen the loots that drop there.<br />here's a good list for ya<br />1. Ascent(time,quam kill)<br />2. EiE/DA(time)<br />3. Arirang(ele.flagged and most of the gods)<br />4. Forsaken(ele.flagged and and huge progress in a short time)<br />5. FoT(ele flagged and doing there best from letting forsaken progress,but thats about it)<br />6. RoS( man RZTW is tough lets get ascent to kill it for us and then say we did it on our own. ele.flagged but not on there own accord. gradz again on the RZTW kill ascent RoS couldnt have done it with out you)<br />7. Union of Power ( VT keyed , a few PoP boss's, &nbsp;when they make there start at PoP flagging they will be in ele. planes in no time)<br />8. SoD and Friends ( same most vt keyed not to sure on the pop progress but a very friendly bunch and they to will see the ele. planes very soon also.)<br />9. Hegemony ( some ssra named , bert kill but thats about it)<br />10. MV,SoV ( nether have made a push to ether vt or pop and if so havent made a push to hard to turn any heads)
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
