								<a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org" title="http://www.rodcetnife.org" target="_blank"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/www_sm.gif" alt="WWW" border="0" /></a>
								<a href="mailto:truman@thewavz.com"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/email_sm.gif" alt="Email" title="Email" border="0" /></a>
							</span>
						</td>
						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1792#msg1792"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1792#msg1792">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #34 on:</b> September 25, 2003, 03:16:52 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							RNwatchers knows very little. <br /><br />1) Ascent<br />2) EiE/DA<br />3-4) Arirang-FoT (Equal Kills list)<br />5-6) RoS-Forsaken<br /><br /><br />The top 6 seem to be the most in contention. <br /><br />Fires of Time has killed Fennin Ro twice, and the Mystial Arbitor of Earth Twice. Have also mastered the Avatar of Dust in Air, which can be a challenging target in itself. <br /><br />Forsaken and RoS are where FoT was 3-4 months ago. Starting to gear up, and will take at least that long if not longer before they are really geared to a point to start working on further progression. Arirang had the time they needed, and they moved forward. <br /><br />No one just jumps into Elemental Planes and starts killing the Elemental Gods to my knowledge. Ascent had the Elementals to themselves for a while, so probably geared up the fastest. The EiE/DA had it shortly there after. <br /><br />Arirang, FoT, Forsaken and RoS will be in competition for the same mobs to gear up and go farther faster. <br /><br />Call it what you will, but Arirang, and FoT are far far ahead of Forsaken and RoS, and unless something radically changes, Arirang and FoT are in the race to see who will next get to Time. Arirang to my knowledge has not downed Cornaiv, Xegony, or the Raithe Council. They have not killed the majority of the Gods.<br /><br />I see Forsaken and RoS in the race to see who will next kill an Elemental God. Forsaken has raw numbers. RoS has great players and a great guild mentality. Only time will tell.<br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
