							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Now, since there is one person from VN boards that I personally feel is an antagonist posting here, and with an anon name, that I tend to not care for, one warning to all people.<br /><br />I will not allow this thread to become a flame ridden mess like the one on VN is. There is a rants and raves section for all the flaming you want. I want this thread kept clean, and discussed rationally.<br /><br />Everyone is entitled to thier opinions. RNWatcher has stated in a calm post his opinion. I don't share that same one, but that is fine.<br /> <br />Any flaming in this thread will not be tolerated, the offending post will be deleted, and the person who posted it banned. <br /><br />I don't care what guild the member is from, mine, yours or your brothers. Fortunately no one has come close, but I felt it best to get this out in the open ahead of time. Everyone has been given fair notice.
