								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1800#msg1800"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1800#msg1800">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #38 on:</b> September 26, 2003, 03:54:59 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I know not of this guild RNwatcher speaks of.. reign of storms ? &nbsp; ;)<br /><br />Sign your real name mate, your comments may hold more merit. &nbsp; :D<br /><br />That RZTW thingy is pretty old news heh and I think we (RoS) quashed any doubts about our ability by killing RTZW on our own then 2 hrs later laying waste to Solusek Ro. So any implications of what Ascent did or did not do for us, at this point seems moot.<br /><br />I am very grateful for the opportunity to raid with them. Awesome bunch of folks.. &nbsp;/hug Clarsah &nbsp; ;D<br /><br />Far as the VT thing goes.. I am so down for hitting that zone, and one day I'm confident we will. Did I mention all I need is the rift &nbsp;heheeh &nbsp;oh yeah and that damn insignia &nbsp;/cry &nbsp;lol<br /><br />Seriously though, at this junction, I'm pretty much in agreement with Kins 1-6. Although I'd put Forsaken ahead of us only b/c they raid the elementals more often and are VT established.<br /><br />I'm really looking forward to seeing how well and fast UoP progresses in PoP once they set their focus on becoming elemental flagged. Those guys impress the hell out of me.<br /><br />On that note, I digress..<br /><br />cheers<br /><br /><br /><br />
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
