							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							RNWatcher sounds like he's in Forsaken for giving them so much favor. <br /><br />I just want point out the obvious difference between FoT and FS.<br /><br />Server Reset 4 days ago:<br />* Forsaken Kills: Hyrdotha, Groinlin the Wise, Behemoth<br /><br />* FoT Kills: <br /><b>PoFire</b> -&gt; Pyronis, Babnoxis the Spider Queen, Magmaton, Arch Mage Yozanni, General Reparm, Blazzax the Omnifiend, Criare Sunmane, Jaxoliz Dawneyes, Quavonis Firetail, General Drauv Flamesinger. &nbsp;<br /><b>PoTactics</b> -&gt; Rallos Zek the Warlord. &nbsp;<br /><b>PoEarth</b> -&gt; Perfected Warder of Earth, Derugoak Bloodwalker, Tantisala Jaggedtooth, A Mystical Arbitor of Earth<br /><b>Sol Ro Tower</b> -&gt; Solusek Ro<br /><br />Yes this was in 1 day. &nbsp;If that isn't progressen, I don't know what is.
