						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1848#msg1848"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=320.msg1848#msg1848">Re:And yet again a Top Ten guilds List</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #43 on:</b> September 30, 2003, 11:37:23 am &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Reading Zaphe's post regarding beign Sol Ro tower flagged. Excellent.<br /><br />Put Hegemony up there in 2 months, perhaps a month by thier own estimation. Generally they've been spot on in thier timeframes and estimates.<br /><br />As I see it. This is current progression, not potential or capability.<br /><br />3t) Arirang<br />5) Forsaken<br />6) Reign of Swords<br />7t) Union of Power / Seekers of Dawn &amp; Co. /<br />9) Hegemony<br />10) Spirit of Verzi<br />11) Century of Flame/Apotheosis (ally iirc)<br />12t) Menacing Visage / Cascade Point<br />13t) Dragon's Fist / Outcast Adventurers<br />15) Brew Masters<br />16) Exiled Knights<br />17) Adv Com/Ecce <br /><br />Ghost Chapel? Tul Acharn? Aurora Knights? Arma Viresque? Addicted to Chaos?<br /><br />- Fs will notch a Fennin kill before RoS.<br />- FoT to hit Time before Arirang.<br />- Hegemony to hit Elementals within a month.
						</td>
					</tr>
