							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							I knew there was a reason I liked Kelce so much &nbsp;;D<br /><br />The only thing I might differ on, is who gets the first Fennin Kill. Forsaken probably will, but I don't consider it a sure thing by any means. I kinda give RoS/Forsaken a 50-50 chance on who might make that one.<br /><br />Give that man a beer.<br /><br /> :beer
